      "a": "Supervision is a regular conversation about the work, and appraisal is usually a yearly look back and forward. <a href=\"https://www.skillsforcare.org.uk/Leadership-management/managing-people/supervision/Supervision.aspx\">Skills for Care describes supervision</a> as a manager meeting regularly with a worker. CareStream tracks both, as two separate types of record."
