      "a": "That is for your service to set, and <a href=\"https://www.skillsforcare.org.uk/Leadership-management/managing-people/supervision/Supervision.aspx\">Skills for Care does not give a set interval</a>. CareStream lets you set the next due date for each session and marks anyone overdue."
